title: A Telegram from Petrograd
subtitle: Zinoviev wants to know why Germany is quiet.
new-page: true
tags: event
priority: -1
view-if: {!
if (typeof RG === 'undefined') { return false; }
if (!RG.lw && this.game.scenes.lw_lib) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
return !!(RG.lw && RG.lw.ready('m_zinoviev'));
!}
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.lw) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
RG.lw.fire('m_zinoviev');
// the district Zinoviev has read about in the papers
RG.lw.setD(RG.lw.best(function (d) { return true; }, function (d) { return RG.lw.dv(d, 'militancy') + (RG.lw.dv(d, 'strike') ? 200 : 0); }));
Q.lw_n = Q.strike_count >= 1 ? 1 : (Q.militancy >= 55 ? 2 : 3);
!}

= A Telegram from Petrograd

The telegram is signed **Zinoviev**, President of the Executive. [? if lw_n = 1 : He has read in the bourgeois press that the workers of [+ lw_d_name +] are on strike, and asks why the strike is not yet general and why the Zentrale is not at its head. ?][? if lw_n = 2 : He has read that the workers of [+ lw_d_name +] are boiling, and asks why the Zentrale is sitting on the lid. ?][? if lw_n = 3 : He notes that Germany is quiet, and asks whether the Zentrale has confused quiet with peace. ?] It ends: "Reply by return."

- @act: Answer with action in [+ lw_d_name +].
- @polite: Send a report with tables.
- @sharp: Reply that the German revolution is made in Germany.

@act
subtitle: [? if lock_moscow_orders = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] The district is called out. Zinoviev is delighted, and the police will be busy.
choose-if: lock_moscow_orders < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids taking orders from Moscow.
on-arrival: {!
RG.lw.against('moscow_orders');
if (Q.lw_d_strike) { RG.spreadStrike(Q.lw_d); } else { RG.startStrike(Q.lw_d); }
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: 6});
RG.ecci('zinoviev', 10);
RG.lw.lean('offensive', 2, 5);
!}

The Zentrale replies in one line: the instruction is being carried out. Zinoviev reads the reports aloud at the Executive.

@polite
subtitle: Zinoviev wanted fire. Lenin likes tables.
on-arrival: {!
RG.ecci('zinoviev', -3);
RG.ecci('lenin', 3);
!}

The reply is twelve pages long: membership by district, the state of the unions, the arms of the Reichswehr. Somebody in Petrograd files it.

@sharp
subtitle: Zinoviev will remember this telegram longer than his own.
on-arrival: {!
Q.independence += 7;
RG.ecci('zinoviev', -10);
RG.lw.lean('luxemburgist', 1, 5);
!}

The Zentrale thanks the President for his interest, and reminds him that the German working class has its own organisations and its own party, which it intends to lead.
